TRAFFIC ADVISORY
...around Ogba/Acme road 

 Due to closure of Acme road from Fumec junction by NNPC and Acme crescent junction :
 Motorist from Agege onward Acme road should navigate thru Fumec junction by NNPC to connect Adeniyi Jones, Aromire to Allen junction.
 They can also  connect Oba Akran from Adeniyi Jones to Ikeja underneath the bridge.
 Likewise, motorists coming from  Acme junction by Lateef Jakande road can go thru Acme crescent to link up with Agidingbi, Cadbury, mobil to Coca-Cola junction.

 Also note that  if you are not on Adeniyi Jones and you are coming from Agege it's best for you to navigate thru Wemco road to connect Lateef Jakande road, Agidingbi to Coca-Cola junction.
LASTMACares!
